Agreed. While cu is a very versatile cmavo, and is quite frequently used
specifically because of this, I doubt there is a single jbopre among us who
does not think that teaching terminators is /extremely/ important,
/especially/ in the very beginning.

When cu is eventually introduced, it's function is made much more clear and
understandable as a result, as well.

